    "body": "{\"answer\":\"The Ask POLY browser path is not fixed, as it may vary based on the device and browser you're using. However, here's a general path for accessing Ask POLY:\\n\\n1. Open Google Chrome or any other browser.\\n2. Type in the address bar: [www.polytechnic.kerala.gov.in](http://www.polytechnic.kerala.gov.in) or the website where Ask POLY is integrated.\\n3. Click on the Ask POLY icon or button, usually found on the homepage or in the menu.\\n4. You'll be redirected to the Ask POLY chat interface, where you can ask your questions and get answers.\\n\\nPlease note that the exact path may differ based on the website or platform where Ask POLY is integrated.\",\"citations\":[],\"usedWeb\":false,\"provider\":\"nvidia\",\"model\":\"meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct\",\"responseId\":\"chatcmpl-ce61dc1d-1de9-44a0-966a-50998aecfd79\",\"knowledgeMode\":\"whole-site-revision-aware-v1\"}",
